# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Centralized MariaDB or PostgreSQL database service shared across applications via Docker Compose"
msgstr "**Açıklama:** Centralized MariaDB veya PostgreSQL Veritabanı hizmeti, uygulamalar aracılığıyla paylaşılan Docker Compose"

