# `TLS [FAIL] TimeoutError after 8s`) Bir MTU mismatch__, Ama bir TLS-katlı
# bug değil. Küçük paketler (TCP-SYN, DNS yanıtları) hayatta kalmak; sertifika
# zinciri ile daha büyük TLS-ServerHello sessiz bir şekilde düştü çünkü MTU ve
# ICMP-needs-frag filtrelendi. When When When When When When When When When
# When When When When When When When When When When When When When When When
# When When When When When When When `auth.docker.io` Tamam ama ama `ghcr.io`
# / / `registry-1.docker.io` Zaman dışarı, ev sahipliği arasındaki zincir boyu
# fark (Cloudflare-fronted , küçük zincir, GitHub/AWS , büyük zincir) MTU'yu
# battaniye TLS bloğu yerine onaylar.
msgid "The classic failure shape (`DNS [OK]`, `TCP [OK]`, `TLS [FAIL] TimeoutError after 8s`) is an __MTU mismatch__, not a TLS-layer bug. Small packets (TCP-SYN, DNS replies) survive; the larger TLS-ServerHello with the certificate chain is dropped silently because the path MTU is below the bridge MTU and ICMP-needs-frag is filtered upstream. When `auth.docker.io` is OK but `ghcr.io` / `registry-1.docker.io` time out, the chain-length difference between hosts (Cloudflare-fronted ≈ small chain, GitHub/AWS ≈ large chain) confirms MTU as the cause rather than a blanket TLS block."
msgstr ""

