# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "What a token leaves open belongs to the line it stands in: `priority` covers every remaining combination in one sweep, `whitelist` keeps the rotation and the row's position in the matrix. A pin the row cannot take aborts the matrix rather than dropping the row, because a dropped row would report a green run for a combination that never ran. Such a pin is `@swarm` on a role without its own stack, `+tor` on a variant that pins `services.tor.enabled` false, or any axis that fights the run's own `mode`, `tor`, `distros`, `filesystem` or `architectures` input, or `:arm64` on a role whose `meta/services.yml` declares `architectures: [amd64]`."
msgstr "Bir token yaprakları açık olan çizgiye ait: `priority` Kalan her kombinasyonu bir süpürücüde kapsar, `whitelist` Döndürmeyi ve sıranın yerini matrixte tutar. Bir pin the row can take aborts the matrix rather than dropping the row, because a left row would report a green run for a together that never ran. Böyle bir pin, `@swarm` Kendi yığını olmadan bir rol üzerinde, `+tor` Bir değişken üzerinde pins `services.tor.enabled` Sahte, ya da koşan herhangi bir eksen `mode`, `tor`, `distros`, `filesystem` veya `architectures` Giriş veya giriş `:arm64` Bir rol üzerinde kimin `meta/services.yml` De ki: `architectures: [amd64]`."

