msgid "WordPress's canonical surface is the public blog front page. The OIDC round-trip fires on `/wp-login.php`, which the `daggerhart-openid-connect-generic` addon auto-redirects to Keycloak (`login_type: auto`, see [`meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml`](./meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml)); the shared personas enter at the site root and never visit that path. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The journeys themselves are not dropped: `test-admin-oidc-login.js` drives the admin login, logout and landing assertion, and `test-rbac-roles.js` drives the Keycloak-group-to-WordPress-role mapping over the same entry point."
msgstr "WordPress'in kanonik yüzeyi halk blogu ön sayfasıdır. OIDC yuvarlak istasyon yangınları `/wp-login.php`, Ve hangisi `daggerhart-openid-connect-generic` Addon auto-redirects to addon auto-rey Keycloak (`login_type: auto`, gör [`meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml`](./meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml))Paylaşılan kişi site köküne girer ve bu yolu asla ziyaret etmez. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Bu nedenle de yemin ederim ki `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` ve `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`.Yolların kendileri düşmez: `test-admin-oidc-login.js` Yönetici girişi, logout ve iniş iddiasını sürücüler ve `test-rbac-roles.js` Sürücüler Keycloak-grup-to-WordPress-role aynı giriş noktası üzerinde haritalama."

