msgid "[OpenBao](https://openbao.org/) is an identity-based secrets and encryption manager governed by the Linux Foundation. It stores application credentials, API keys, service and database credentials, automation and agent identities, short-lived tokens and encryption keys behind a policy engine, and can act as an internal certificate authority."
